WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.220
Someone once said:

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:53.120
There is a gingko tree with leafs of crispy,

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:56.790
piping hot, fluffy soft, meaty fried mackerel

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:01.130
that almost swim as they 
blow through the air...

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.130
The Mackerelhair Tree!

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.040
With the light acidic taste of pineapple

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:14.010
mixed together with the 
deep sweetness of prunes...

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:17.440
The Pineapprune!

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.850
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:26.850
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:33.090
A battle to the death 
between Toriko and Tommy

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:36.530
over the Century Soup that only appears 
once every 100 years unfolded.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:41.570
Meanwhile, the Gourmet Show Window 
began to crumble before Komatsu,

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:44.340
who had gone to capture the soup.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.340
But then, Teppei used a Protect 
Tree to protect the Show Window.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:55.780
Then, Komatsu had discovered the soup, 
but was attacked by a miniature GT Robot.

00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:00.890
Around that time, Tommy had 
unlocked his full power,

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:05.520
and Toriko unleashed his new techniques, 
the Leg Fork and Leg Knife!

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:09.460
But, Toriko used up his last 
energy driving Tommy back...

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:14.630
Just when he thought it was all over, 
the Gourmet Reviver Teppei appears!

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:22.370
Wondrous Power! Gourmet Reviver 
Teppei Joins the Battle!

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.310
Who the hell are you?

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.980
Capture far too many ingredients and...

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:39.560
I'll capture you, Gourmet Corp.!

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:42.230
Gourmet Reviver Teppei!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.100
What the...

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.400
A Gourmet Reviver?

00:03:55.510 --> 00:04:00.080
The only person who would know how 
to Knock these rare insects...

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.110
It was you?!

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.680
Say something, damn you!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:09.750
The more words you speak, 
the less weight they have.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:13.820
Sooner or later they become nearly 
weightless, fluttering in the breeze...

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.130
What the hell is a Gourmet 
Reviver doing here?

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:20.030
Did someone put out a request 
to capture us, huh?!

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.930
It is true that part of my 
job is to arrest those people

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:26.770
who capture or trade in illegal ingredients.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.670
But this time, I have no business with you.

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:31.970
However!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:35.980
I'll be happy to capture 
you if you get in my way.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:39.010
Vice-Chef of the Gourmet Corp., Tommyrod!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.080
Crap, he's not thinking straight!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.020
Teppei has the blood of Knocking 
Master Jiro running through him!

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.020
Even among Gourmet Revivers, 
his skills are top-notch!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.430
Vice-Chef!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:55.300
Bring it on, you!

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:59.200
Capture me, you say?!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.700
Impact Knocking...

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:02.800
Medium!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.520
Oh? He has quite a lot of nerve ganglions.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.020
Are they insectoid?

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:19.390
I'll penetrate deeper into his body!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:21.860
Welldone!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.100
Tommy-sama!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.600
Vice-Chef!

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:43.940
If you hadn't have been wounded,

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.010
I wouldn't have had the 
option of Knocking you.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:51.550
Even so, to be able to put 
up that much of a fight

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.390
against a Vice-Chef of the Gourmet Corp....

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:57.290
Toriko, you're really something.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.300
I can't...

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.330
I can't move...

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:14.810
N-No way... I-I've... been Knocked...?!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.010
I got no choice...

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.710
In this case...

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:30.390
It can't be!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:39.900
What?!

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:48.410
I didn't want to hatch 
it if I could help it...

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:51.140
It's just too... ferocious.

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:56.180
A demon that will devour... everything!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.810
Parasite Emperor

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:31.250
W-What the heck is that?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.580
It hatched!

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:34.320
The crossbred egg made from

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:37.950
combining a bunch of extremely 
fearsome parasitic insects!

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:42.460
The Hybrid Beast Tommy-sama has been 
keeping warm in his body all this time!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:51.170
Damn the thing... It took 
with it most of my energy...

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.300
Such a problem child...

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:59.940
Run wild all... you want...

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:21.860
It shoots freezing breath!

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:23.500
What the hell kind of creature is it?

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:14.710
Freezing breath and superheated gas...

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:17.280
It can shoot spider's webs 
and scorpion poison, too?

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.050
This thing's dangerous.

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:20.650
Now's our chance, Barry!

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:22.220
Let's get the soup!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.820
And besides, we'll just get 
ourselves eaten staying here!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.090
Hold it, Bogie.

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:29.860
We've got a message from Yuu.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.230
I see.

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:36.670
Bogie, there's no reason 
for us to be here anymore.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.510
Komatsu-kun! Komatsu-kun!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.790
Komatsu-kun! Komatsu-kun!

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:58.260
Okay! We got the soup!

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:00.330
Let's get the hell outta here!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.530
Hey, you guys!

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:04.000
It's really not a good idea 
to go outside right now!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.700
Honestly, I think staying here would be best.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:06.730
We're not that stupid!

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:10.530
You think we'll let ourselves be wrapped 
up in fighting the Parasite Emperor?!

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:13.270
Sorry, but we've already 
gotten what we came for!

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.710
Mission complete!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.410
Later, losers!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.840
They'll just leave their 
Knocked comrade behind?

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.780
We don't need to worry about Tommy-sama.

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:22.510
He's got a demon's will to live.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.520
It'd be presumptuous for 
us to worry about him!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.060
W-What the...?

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.680
W-What the...?

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:22.970
Looks like the ruler of Ice 
Hell, Hellboros, has shown up.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.810
Does the air taste nice, when breathing 
it for the first time in 100 years?

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:26.810
That's...

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:29.880
The Beast that was originally on top 
of the food chain of this continent.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.410
I revived it.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:41.320
It's also my job to set free creatures 
that have been Knocked around the world.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:48.130
But reviving this monster 
definitely makes things tricky...

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:04.210
T-That thing's already outgrown its shell?!

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:06.110
What an incredible growth rate!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.840
It lifted it up!

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:17.650
Going right after the boss of the 
continent without hesitation...

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.480
What a crazy bug!

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:23.190
On the other hand, Hellboros hasn't 
eaten a thing in 100 years,

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:25.520
so it doesn't think of anything except food.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.360
Jeez...

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:47.980
Gourmet Reviver.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.580
I'm in the Gourmet Mafia.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:56.420
I have captured and traded 
in many illegal ingredients.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:59.320
I'm prepared to be captured by you.

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:01.490
But, I have a request.

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:07.060
Would you stand by while I go get the soup?

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:11.670
And if possible, I'd like 
to bury them afterwards.

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:15.570
Let the Show Window be their grave marker.

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:22.110
I'm the only one that can move, after all.

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:27.350
Until then, overlook me.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.420
I have no intention of burying them.

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:36.220
For there is no need to.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:43.730
I can see these outlaws sparkling 
brighter than the Gourmet Show Window.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:15:00.180
Even after taking all that 
damage, he's still breathing.

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:01.720
Even after he hasn't been able to

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.550
regulate his body temperature 
with the Shivering stopped...

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:07.420
His body is still functioning properly.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:10.990
What an incredible will 
to live you have, Toriko.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:26.040
Nail Needle.

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:36.480
The leaves of a Protect Tree 
can stimulate the heart

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:39.020
and have components useful 
for cardiovascular treatment.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:42.990
It's quite powerful, but I suspect 
you can handle it, Toriko.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.520
Your blood pressure will spike,

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.030
and that should bring your 
body temperature back up.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:56.240
Hello there. Awake are we, Toriko?

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.470
Are you feeling terrible?

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:58.870
Who are you?

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:01.040
I'll explain later.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:04.640
Now then... Komatsu-kun has found 
the soup and is waiting for you.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:08.410
Komatsu!

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:13.320
I resuscitated your heart 
and lungs for a time,

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.350
but your body is still considerably damaged.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.660
This is a Fertility Seed.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.790
It's bitter, but just 
swallow it without chewing.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.290
Take this, Toriko.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:26.000
But it's a regulated substance 
under the 8 Gourmet Laws...

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.630
Whatever, just take it!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:33.440
There's a bit of poison in that seed.

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:35.940
It'll kill off a few of your cells.

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.480
But after that, you'll have a super recovery.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.360
It's originally a medicine

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.630
that accelerates your own body's 
healing process to the maximum.

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:59.230
On the the other hand, these 
people are more severe...

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:03.730
Why are you saving us?

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:13.410
After going around reviving ingredients 
for as many years as I have, I can tell.

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.880
I can tell their lifespan.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.780
Decaying ingredients...

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:21.480
Life where revival is no longer possible...

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:25.190
The Gourmet Show Window is dead.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.620
I cannot revive it any longer.

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:29.490
What?

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.500
On the other hand, I can also 
tell which life can be revived.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:35.800
These lives are not dead yet.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:42.070
Although I have other reasons 
for saving Toriko...

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.540
Both heart and lungs have stopped...

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.310
He's completely frozen stiff.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:50.950
This one's gonna take some time.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:53.920
It'll be up to him whether I can revive him.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.660
Doctor Aloe.

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.400
Its leaves are effective against 
frost bite and burns...

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.100
It can also main maintain body temperature.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.500
Komatsu...

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:11.960
Komatsu-kun, Komatsu-kun!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.130
Komatsu-kun!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.930
Komatsu...

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.040
Hey...

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.000
Everyone...

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:30.840
Oh, right! Where's the soup?!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.450
Komatsu-kun...

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:47.930
I'm counting on you, Komatsu!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.340
I...

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.910
I...!

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.520
Komatsu!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:20.690
Sorry I'm late, Komatsu!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:32.840
Toriko-san...

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:35.640
I...

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:38.440
I...

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:47.850
I wasn't able to protect the soup!!!

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:57.590
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.860
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:05.230
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.700
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:12.070
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:15.110
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:18.910
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:22.450
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:25.620
Two-way communication!

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:29.120
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:32.860
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:36.230
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.100
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:42.800
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:46.370
Fight with bravery!

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:50.080
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:21:54.510 --> 00:21:56.520
Gourmet News!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:58.990
I'm your host, Tina!

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:00.990
The Fertility Seed!

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:03.960
This seed can cause your body 
to recover super quickly!

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.690
It's bitter at first,

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:08.730
but I heard that before long, its sweet 
flavor spreads throughout your mouth!

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:12.400
It's a lot like the sweetness 
of a strawberry, for instance!

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:15.130
Today I'm going to show you a way to taste

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:18.500
the sweetness of a strawberry 
if you don't have one on hand!

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:21.170
If you drink milk after eating an apple,

00:22:21.170 --> 00:22:24.080
they say the tastes of strawberries 
will fill your mouth!

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:26.550
Apple is all set!

00:22:30.520 --> 00:22:32.920
Milk is also all set!

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:38.020
It's true!

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:39.620
What a heaping help of illusion!

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:41.360
It's strawberries!

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:43.660
Presenting such amazing info to my viewers...

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:46.360
Breaking news! We've got 
a strawberry in progress!

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:54.840
A strawberry... robbery... A stroberry.

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:58.080
So cold...

00:22:58.080 --> 00:23:02.050
But this bitterness will turn to 
sweetness one day, I'm sure of it!

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:04.050
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:08.950
All the hardship for this soup...

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.200
Since we've made it this far, let's eat it together!

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:11.590
What?!

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:13.420
What?! Only one person gets to have it?

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:16.930
The Last Drop! Who Will Get the Century Soup?!

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.210
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
